<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Code Assess System</title>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #333333;
      }

      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 40px 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .logo {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .logo h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 26px;
        color: #2563eb;
      }

      h2 {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-size: 24px;
        color: #222222;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 12px 0;
        color: #555555;
      }

      .highlight {
        margin: 25px 0;
        padding: 18px;
        background-color: #f0f7ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }

      .highlight p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #333333;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 35px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #888888;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="logo">
          <h1>Code Assess System</h1>
        </div>

        <h2>Welcome, <%= name %>!</h2>

        <p>
          Thank you for joining <strong>Code Assess System</strong>.
          Your account has been created successfully.
        </p>

        <div class="highlight">
          <p>
            You can now access assessments, participate in coding challenges,
            track your progress, and manage your account from one place.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p>
          We’re excited to have you with us and wish you the best of luck
          with your upcoming assessments.
        </p>

        <div class="footer">
          <p>
            This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.
          </p>

          <p>
            &copy; <%= year %> Code Assess System. All rights reserved.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>